<main class="pc" data-product-core="your-cranium"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 01 / Personal Navigator</p><h1>What do you notice about yourself?</h1><p class="pc-lead">Create a personal observation map without registration or scoring.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/" aria-current="page">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Select directions you wish to observe. A selection only means you want to pay attention to it.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>Physical</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Freedom of head movement" value="physical-1"><span>Freedom of head movement</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Perceived neck effort" value="physical-2"><span>Perceived neck effort</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="End-of-day comfort" value="physical-3"><span>End-of-day comfort</span></label></fieldset></div><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>Cognitive</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Sustained attention" value="cognitive-1"><span>Sustained attention</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Mental fatigue" value="cognitive-2"><span>Mental fatigue</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Perceived clarity" value="cognitive-3"><span>Perceived clarity</span></label></fieldset></div><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>Emotional</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Feeling of tension" value="emotional-1"><span>Feeling of tension</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Ability to relax" value="emotional-2"><span>Ability to relax</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Perception of your state" value="emotional-3"><span>Perception of your state</span></label></fieldset></div><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>Professional</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Comfort at work" value="professional-1"><span>Comfort at work</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Workload" value="professional-2"><span>Workload</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="Recovery after work" value="professional-3"><span>Recovery after work</span></label></fieldset></div></div><p data-js hidden>Selected: <output data-count>0</output></p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Clear</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>Save on your device</button></div><p class="pc-note">Selections are not retained after reloading and are not submitted automatically. Export creates a local JSON file.</p><a class="pc-link" href="../../ru/recognition/">Extended 137-item checklist (Russian) ↗</a></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button primary" href="../configuration/">Continue · Configuration ↗</a><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Discuss your individual enquiry</a></div><details class="pc-legacy"><summary>Existing materials</summary><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="crumbs">CRANIO / Your CRANIO</div><h2>Your current state. Your observations. Your continuity.</h2><p class="lead">This is the personal layer where TwinMind brings together experience, context, history and the next step.</p><section class="section"><div class="eyebrow">Your CRANIO</div><h2>Your current state. Your observations. Your continuity.</h2><p class="lead">This is the personal layer where TwinMind brings together experience, context, history and the next step.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Observation</h3><p>Separate observation from interpretation.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Context</h3><p>Context makes a state comparable over time.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Verification</h3><p>Before, after, context and time remain visible.</p></div></div></section><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../start/">Start an observation</a><a class="btn" href="../explore/">Explore</a></div></article></div></details></section></main>